Comment (internal/service/notificationtroubleshooting/service.go:657):
`staleCount` suppresses any DB error by assigning the query result to `_` and returning the count regardless. This can silently report 0 stale jobs when the query fails (e.g., permission/migration issues), making the health endpoint misleading. Please handle and propagate/log the error (or surface it as a warning in the health response) instead of discarding it.

