Comment (internal/service/notificationtroubleshooting/service.go:745):
`subscriberCounts` swallows DB errors by returning zero counts, which can incorrectly trigger "no subscribers" warnings and mislead diagnostics. Prefer propagating the query error (or surfacing it as a troubleshooting warning) so admins can distinguish "0 subscribers" from "unable to query subscriptions".
